  "The web encoding contract (web/motion/post.mjs planScenePasses) changes the encoding only through a pass's input or output field. srgb-decode is registered with input any, so a list that names srgb-decode itself before a linear-input pass gets a second decode: [srgb-decode, film] plans as [srgb-decode, srgb-decode, film]. The C++ plan follows the web plan, because the web plan is the oracle. Reported to the owner of web/shaders and web/motion; not changed here."
